    <string name="saber_about_title">About the Saber integration</string>
    <string name="saber_about_summary">Saber itself is not modified. This app uses an accessibility service to detect when Saber\'s window is focused. With root, it reads Saber\'s settings file to see the active tool, and adds a virtual stylus button that Android merges with the pen\'s input. Saber\'s developers aren\'t involved and aren\'t responsible for this, so please don\'t report problems with it to Saber.</string>
